    "title": "MICROSERVICE-batchinsertion-Replace Pharmacy Prescriptions Transfer-v5-spec",
    "description": "The Pharmacy Prescriptions Transfer API facilitates the efficient replacement of pharmacy prescriptions within the healthcare system. This endpoint allows authorized users to update existing prescriptions by transferring them to new records as needed. It is particularly useful for pharmacy staff managing prescriptions in systems that require adjustments due to changes in patient needs or medication availability. Typical consumers of this API include pharmacy operations teams and healthcare applications that integrate prescription management functionalities.",
    "version": "1.0"
  },
